# Tending Aged Wounds (CoP 3-4, mission.cop.tending_aged_wounds). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with 3-4 current (a
# GM; Status 0). Lower Jeuno's zone-in (Status 0): 70; finished: Status 1. _6tc (Status 1): 22; finished: the mission
# completes (3-5 current).
# A Crystalline Prophecy is not current (the default char has its own Lower Jeuno zone-in).
lists LowerJeuno/onZoneIn/1 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/70 LowerJeuno/_6tc/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/22
char zone=Metalworks pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Acp TheEchoAwakens current       # A Crystalline Prophecy's own Lower Jeuno zone-in is off
mission Cop TendingAgedWounds current
login
warp 15.5,-0.1,-6.1 LowerJeuno               # Status 0: 70; Status 1
trigger _6tc                            # Status 1: 22
finish                                  # complete: 3-5 current
